{"id":"vod_sn_39025","vodId":"39025","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"魔法使的注意事项","name_cn":"魔法使的注意事项","date":"2003-01-01","year":"2003","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/03fd6e107bcfed6ed44d8bc4ae255ae8.jpg"},"summary":"这是一个人人都可以成为魔法使的世界，只要办理了相关的手续，每个人都可以合法的使用魔法，让生活更加便捷。但是，魔法使分为见习和正式两类，见习魔法使唯有遵循魔法守则，好好修炼，多多利用魔法帮助他人，才有机会转正。我们的主角，天正可爱的少女菊池梦（宫崎葵 配音）就是这样一位善良的见习魔法使。　　为了接受魔法使的训练，梦从家乡来到了东京。繁华的大城市让她眼花缭乱，幸亏路人的相助，梦才得以找到自己的导师小山田雅美（诹访部顺一 配音）。为什么要使用魔法？魔法究竟带来的是幸福还是灾难？带着这些疑问，梦开始了自己的魔法修行，在经历了世间种种的悲欢离合后，梦逐渐的明白了魔法存在的意义。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:40","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UP2ydkTU4c1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/n4CXWJrscf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zQExisQzwB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/b7Dvuq3LFX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vQaSSwpkFp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XmCSx65YRh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ixH5Tff7Z41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/C35vrXPAex1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FtArWK7syv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XfwUn5evmt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nMGUBmCZ3r1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SCf3n0P50F1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:51.489Z"}